# Auto-deploy

After completing implementation work in this repo, commit and push to `origin/main` without asking the user for deployment confirmation.

- Do not ask "want me to deploy?" after feature work
- Use clear commit messages focused on why
- Push to `main` so Vercel deploys automatically

Exception: still ask before destructive git operations (force push, hard reset, etc.).
